<title>USA: AMRE no comment on trading in its shares.</title>
<headline>AMRE no comment on trading in its shares.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMRE Inc, parent company of Century 21 Home Improvements Inc, said on Wednesday it was against company policy to comment on trading activity in its shares. The company's common stock closed down 1-7/8 at 12, on volume of 339,900.</p>
<p>AMRE also owns American Remodelling Inc, which provides siding, windows and cabinet resurfacing under the Century 21 Home Improvements Network.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
